"P50192150" "Kidnap Akarist"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P94155031" "I don't care if it's weird out there, kid! I need that Akarist guy, and I'm counting on you to get him for me."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P527523211" "This place is strange in a way you can feel deep inside. But Akarist is out here, and Johnny wants you to bring him back."

