"P4073569419" "And here I am left to my own devices. <em>There are few things as depressing as an incompetant kidnapping."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - RescueObjectiveText 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - RescueObjectiveTextSingular 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - LeadToObjectiveText 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// LeadToObjectiveText :
"P2312314064" "Take Akarist to Portal"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - LeadToObjectiveTextSingular 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - MinutesBetweenAutoWaveAttacks  
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - AutoWaveAttackCount  
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - WaveShout 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Escape 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2701629290" "You kidnapped Akarist"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskBegin 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P301962440" "You take front row tickets to Johnny Sonata's show for Grant Naylor."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2188910255" "That Akarist guy, what a piece of work. So he gets here and he just sits down and starts going over that contract. No complaints, no nothing! What a professional, huh? Just like you, kid. A real pro, all the way. He said he'd have something for me soon. I shoulda had someone nab him years ago! Hey, when he's done, I'm gonna want you in on this. Johnny Sonata don't forget the people who've helped him, kid."
// RandomFameString :
"P2828404089" "Wailer attacks are up all over St. Martial! What's got them so stirred up?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission4 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1494879041" "Those Circle guys are jerks, I tell, every last one of 'em! Even that Akarist guy. Oh, he went over that contract, and he told me what he found, sure. Then a whole pack of heroes busted him out! People today got no loyalty, kid. Anyway, I know what to do next. It's gotta be about these Wailer guys. Akarist, he said that they would know how to stop all of this. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>So I need you to find one of their leaders. Talk to Hardcase. He'll know.</A> That's what I pay him for."
// AcceptString :
"P438176701" "Talk to Hardcase"
// SendOffString :
"P2771623236" "Ask him where the biggest bunch of those screaming demons is holed up. Akarist said you'd find some kind of king of the things there. And once Hardcase tells you where to go, then bring that thing back. I pulled some strings and got some Fortunatas comin' in to work their charms on it."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission4_Part1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3960676558" "Hardcase is the one you want to talk to. Don't keep me waiting, kid."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1853368485" "Now he's interested in the wailers? He leaves me to deal with this for how long, and now he wants you to take care of it? Fine. The biggest group of them right now is down in the sewers. I can tell you where to go and how to get there. If he's interested now, it must be because he's found a way to save his miserable hide. Well, as long as it keeps people from getting hurt, I can handle that."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission4_Part2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2206818494" "Defeat Wailer Lord"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P173205054" "Hardcase told you where to go, right? Then what are you talking to me for? Go on, kid, get to it!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P2485528900" "The cries of the wailers echo down the tunnels."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_DISPLAYNAME 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P198735042" "Wailer Lord"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_VILLAIN 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1470153062" "Toniiiiiiiight! We striiiiiiiike!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P1593655326" "Nooooooooo Escaaaaape!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - WailerLord 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Description :
"P725137794" "Defeat Wailer Lord""

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3231412543" "You have defeated the Wailer Lord"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3902030589" "You have captured the Wailer Lord"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P4052314336" "That Wailer big-shot's gonna have something to cry about when those Fortunatas are done with him. And then I'll know where to find what I'm looking for. And it's all thanks to you, kid."
// RandomFameString :
"P3012401304" "Is it just me, or have the Wailers been quieter lately. Almost like they were mourning something."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission5 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3491152698" "That wailer thing, it talked all right. Now I know where to find what I'm lookin' for, but I still gotta find a way to get there. So, I talked to some people, and came up with a plan. Now, I got me some a' them Mu mystic types on loan from that Mu'Drakhan guy. They may be all about 'denying the mortal' and all that, but you show the right guy a good time, and you can get what ya want. They're working on a ritual now, something to find what belongs to me and what I've wanted back all these years. But more of <A HREF={ACCEPT}>those wailer things are coming, and they're gonna try to stop my mystic boys. And that's where you come in.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P2943360922" "Stop the Wailer from disrupting the ritual"
// SendOffString :
"P340625127" "I knew I could count on you, kid. So, here's what you have to do. I got those Mu Mystics using the two obelisks outside the Giza like a pair of rabbit-ear antennae. Now, if those wailers over-run things, that's where I'll need you to swing into action. I want you to be waiting in the truck, so you can jump in if trouble comes up. Get those Mystics back on station so they can finish this thing. This is one step away from the end, kid. We're almost there."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P990710627" "Rescue endangered mystics"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2139472557" "I knew there was gonna be trouble. It's on you, kid. You gotta get them mystics back to the obelisk-thing so they can finish."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P1836088781" "Johnny Sonata was right. The ritual's been broken up and the wailers have the mystics."

